{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_rengar_bush": {
        "attack": "【草丛版】<#ff9028ff>无形掠食者<>：草丛里、复活、脱战<#ffb900ff>3秒<>或R后，下次攻击扑向目标造成<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150%<>伤害。技能和扑击各得1点<#ff9028ff>残暴<>，满4点强化下个技能。<#ff9028ff>残忍无情<>（自动，<#ffb900ff>5秒<>）：攻击造成<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<>伤害，攻速+40%；强化时<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>。<#ff9028ff>连招<>：空中Q、三Q。",
        "ult": "对交战中的英雄发动：伪装<#ffb900ff>5秒<>，移速+40%，下次攻击为扑击，额外造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<>伤害，<#ef5350ff>护甲-25%<><#ffb900ff>4秒<>。<#ff9028ff>连招R一套<>：R→扑击→E禁锢→Q。<#ff9028ff>骨齿项链<>：击杀或助攻每个敌方英雄各得一枚战利品（最多5枚，阵亡不丢），攻击力最多+15%。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_rengar_bush": {
        "attack": "【草叢版】<#ff9028ff>潛行怒獅<>：草叢裡、復活、脫戰<#ffb900ff>3秒<>或R後，下次攻擊撲向目標造成<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150%<>傷害。技能和撲擊各得1點<#ff9028ff>兇殘<>，滿4點強化下個技能。<#ff9028ff>兇殘打擊<>（自動，<#ffb900ff>5秒<>）：攻擊造成<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<>傷害，攻速+40%；強化時<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>。<#ff9028ff>連招<>：空中Q、三Q。",
        "ult": "對交戰中的英雄發動：偽裝<#ffb900ff>5秒<>，跑速+40%，下次攻擊為撲擊，額外造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<>傷害，<#ef5350ff>護甲-25%<><#ffb900ff>4秒<>。<#ff9028ff>連招R一套<>：R→撲擊→E定身→Q。<#ff9028ff>骨牙項鍊<>：擊殺或助攻每個敵方英雄各得一枚戰利品（最多5枚，陣亡不丟），攻擊力最多+15%。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_rengar_bush": {
        "attack": "[Bush] Blade swings. <#ff9028ff>Unseen Predator<>: in brush, on respawn, <#ffb900ff>3s<> out of combat or after R, his next attack leaps at a distant target for <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150%<>. Skills and leaps give 1 <#ff9028ff>Ferocity<>; at 4 his next skill is empowered. <#ff9028ff>Savagery<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>5s<>): an attack for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> and +40% attack speed; empowered <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>. <#ff9028ff>Combos<>: air Q, triple Q.",
        "ult": "On a champion in a fight: camouflaged for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, +40% move speed; his next attack is a leap for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> more and <#ef5350ff>-25% armour<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. <#ff9028ff>Combo R one-shot<>: R, leap, rooting E, Savagery. <#ff9028ff>Bonetooth Necklace<>: a takedown on each enemy champion is a Trophy (up to 5, kept through death), up to +15% attack."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_rengar_bush": {
        "attack": "[수풀] <#ff9028ff>보이지 않는 포식자<>: 수풀 안, 부활, <#ffb900ff>3초<> 비전투 또는 R 후 다음 공격은 멀리 도약해 <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150%<>의 피해. 스킬과 도약마다 <#ff9028ff>흉포<> 1, 4가 되면 다음 스킬 강화. <#ff9028ff>포악함<>(자동, <#ffb900ff>5초<>): 공격이 <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<>의 피해, 공격 속도 +40%; 강화 시 <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>. <#ff9028ff>연계<>: 공중 Q, 트리플 Q.",
        "ult": "교전 중인 챔피언에게: <#ffb900ff>5초<> 위장, 이동 속도 +40%, 다음 공격은 도약으로 <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<>의 추가 피해와 <#ffb900ff>4초<> <#ef5350ff>방어력 -25%<>. <#ff9028ff>연계 R 원콤<>: R→도약→E 속박→Q. <#ff9028ff>뼈이빨 목걸이<>: 적 챔피언마다 처치 관여 시 전리품 1개(최대 5개, 사망해도 유지), 공격력 최대 +15%."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_rengar_bush": {
        "attack": "【茂み版】刃で攻撃。<#ff9028ff>見えざる襲撃者<>：茂みの中、復活時、<#ffb900ff>3秒<>非戦闘またはR後、次の攻撃で遠くの敵に飛びかかり<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150%<>。スキルと跳躍ごとに<#ff9028ff>獰猛<>1、4で次のスキル強化。<#ff9028ff>逆上<>（自動、<#ffb900ff>5秒<>）：攻撃が<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<>、攻撃速度+40%；強化時<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>。<#ff9028ff>コンボ<>：空中Q、トリプルQ。",
        "ult": "交戦中のチャンピオンに：<#ffb900ff>5秒<>カモフラージュ、移動速度+40%、次の攻撃は跳躍で<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<>追加、<#ffb900ff>4秒<><#ef5350ff>物理防御-25%<>。<#ff9028ff>コンボR一撃<>：R→跳躍→Eスネア→Q。<#ff9028ff>骨牙の首飾り<>：敵チャンピオンごとにキル関与でトロフィー1個（最大5個、デスでも保持）、攻撃力最大+15%。"
      }
    }
  }
}
